{
  "_comment": [
    "规则书源示例模板 —— 复制到 ./rules/ 或 $NOVEL_RULES_DIR 下即可被自动加载 (文件名以 _ 开头的会被跳过)。",
    "常用键: 顶层 site_key/base_url/encoding/format/hosts/headers/resolve/priority",
    "        搜索 search, 详情+目录 book, 正文 chapter, 分页 pages",
    "JSON 接口: 顶层或段内写 \"format\": \"json\", selector 改用点号路径 (见下方注释)",
    "校验: novel-cli sources check ./rules/_example-template.json",
    "安装: novel-cli sources add ./rules/_example-template.json"
  ],
  "site_key": "example",
  "site_name": "示例书源",
  "base_url": "https://www.example.com",
  "encoding": "utf-8",
  "format": "html",
  "priority": 200,
  "hosts": ["www.example.com", "example.com"],
  "headers": {
    "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)"
  },

  "search": {
    "url": "https://www.example.com/search.php?q={keyword}",
    "item": "div.result-list dl",
    "priority": 200,
    "book_id_regex": "/book/(\\d+)",
    "fields": {
      "title": { "selector": "dd h3 a", "attr": "text" },
      "url": { "selector": "dt a", "attr": "href" },
      "cover": { "selector": "dt a img", "attr": "src" },
      "author": { "selector": "dd.book_other", "attr": "text", "regex": "作者：\\s*(\\S+)", "group": 1 },
      "latest": { "selector": "dd.book_other a", "attr": "text" },
      "update": { "selector": "dd.update", "attr": "text" }
    }
  },

  "_comment_json": [
    "若某段是 AJAX/JSON 接口, 在该段 (或顶层) 加 \"format\": \"json\" 后, selector 改用点号路径:",
    "  \"format\": \"json\",",
    "  \"method\": \"POST\",",
    "  \"json_body\": { \"kw\": \"{raw_keyword}\", \"page\": \"{page}\" },",
    "  \"item\": \"data.list\",          路径末尾的数组会自动展开为各元素",
    "  \"fields\": {",
    "    \"title\": { \"selector\": \"name\", \"attr\": \"text\" },",
    "    \"tags\":  { \"selector\": \"tags[*]\", \"attr\": \"text\", \"multi\": true }",
    "  }",
    "分页: JSON 响应通常不回链下一页, 请改用 \"pages\": { \"url\": \"...\", \"start\": 2, \"max_pages\": 20 }"
  ],

  "book": {
    "url": "{base_url}/book/{book_id}/",
    "headers": { "Referer": "{base_url}/" },
    "pages": {
      "url": "{base_url}/book/{book_id}/index_{page}.html",
      "start": 2
    },
    "fields": {
      "book_name": { "selector": "meta[property='og:novel:book_name']", "attr": "content" },
      "author": { "selector": "meta[property='og:novel:author']", "attr": "content" },
      "cover_url": { "selector": "meta[property='og:image']", "attr": "content" },
      "summary": { "selector": "meta[property='og:description']", "attr": "content" },
      "tags": { "selector": "meta[property='og:novel:category']", "attr": "content", "multi": true }
    },
    "chapters": {
      "item": "div.listmain dl dd a",
      "title": { "attr": "text" },
      "url": { "attr": "href" },
      "id_regex": "/(\\d+)\\.html",
      "id_group": 1
    }
  },

  "chapter": {
    "url": "{base_url}/book/{book_id}/{chapter_id}.html",
    "headers": { "Referer": "{base_url}/book/{book_id}/" },
    "pages": {
      "url": "{base_url}/book/{book_id}/{chapter_id}_{page}.html",
      "start": 2
    },
    "title": { "selector": "div.bookname h1", "attr": "text" },
    "content": { "selector": "div#content", "attr": "inner_text" },
    "replace": [["&nbsp;", " "], ["\u3000", " "]],
    "drop": ["^第\\(\\d+/\\d+\\)页$", "^本章未完"]
  },

  "resolve": {
    "book": "^/book/(\\d+)/?$",
    "chapter": "^/book/(\\d+)/(\\d+)\\.html$"
  }
}
